📖 Overview

Welcome to the System Setup Scripts repository! This project contains a collection of robust, modular, and highly optimized setup scripts designed to bootstrap a fresh OS installation into a fully-fledged development, AI, robotics, and gaming powerhouse.

Currently tailored around the Lenovo LOQ (RTX 5060 / i7-13700HX), these scripts are dynamic enough to handle various hardware configurations gracefully.
✨ Key Features

    🧩 Highly Modular: Choose exactly what you need via an interactive graphical menu.
    🛡️ Security Hardened: Built-in firewall configuration, SSH hardening, and AppArmor profiles.
    🔄 Idempotent Execution: Safe to re-run. Checkpoint tracking resumes exactly where it left off.
    🚀 AI & Robotics Ready: Out-of-the-box support for ROS 2 (Humble), PyTorch, CUDA, and Ollama.
    🎨 Beautifully Configured: Installs Wayland/X11 Desktop Environments (Hyprland, Niri, Qtile) with stunning themes.
    🔍 Self-Testing Architecture: Pre-flight checks and post-stage validation ensure everything works optimally.

